    var: A mutable `Tensor`. Must be one of the following types: `float32`, `float64`, `int32`, `uint8`, `int16`, `int8`, `complex64`, `int64`, `qint8`, `quint8`, `qint32`, `bfloat16`, `qint16`, `quint16`, `uint16`, `complex128`, `half`, `uint32`, `uint64`.
